* ARUNZ - RUN A NAMED TEXT ALIAS

SYSOP ONLY. Private utility; use the local sysop console.

A - Purpose, syntax and examples

:A
* ARUNZ - RUN A NAMED TEXT ALIAS

SYSOP ONLY. Private utility; use the local sysop console.

Syntax:
    SYSUTLS:ARUNZ alias [parameters]

Finds a named command sequence in ALIAS.CMD and expands its parameters.
The alias can run several commands, so inspect it before use.

This is the text-alias interpreter, not SUBMIT. The installed command
search path determines where it finds its alias file.

See HELP COMMANDS for the command index.
